flowchart TD
    A([Start])
    --> B[Administrator opens User Group]
    --> C[Choose new Scope]
    --> D[Estimate affected reach]
    --> E[Show impact]
    --> F{High impact?}

    F -- Yes --> G[Require explicit confirmation]
    --> H{Confirmed?}

    H -- No --> I([Cancel])
    H -- Yes --> J[Save new Scope]

    F -- No --> J

    J --> K[Mark pending synchronization]
    --> L([Completed])
